 ## Background
-Originated in the context of adaptive sampling and reconstruction for volume visualization, specifically within the GVDB (GPU Voxel Database) framework [S1, unofficial]. It is part of a suite of kernels for interactive volume rendering, leveraging sparse voxel octrees for efficient memory access and traversal.
